# Seamless

A personal music diary for Android.

## Features

- Local music library
- Android audio playback
- Music selection
- Diary entries
- Local diary storage
- Basic theme customization
- Custom launcher icon

## Build requirements

- Android Studio
- JDK 17
- Android SDK 35

## Build the APK

Open the project in Android Studio.

Allow Gradle to sync.

Then build the debug APK using:

    gradle assembleDebug

The APK will be located at:

    app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk

